  "reference": "Genesis 48",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "48",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 48"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "48",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this Joseph was told, “Behold, your father is ill”; so he took with him his two sons, Manasseh and Ephraim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it was told to Jacob, “Your son Joseph has come to you”; then Israel summoned his strength, and sat up in bed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jacob said to Joseph, “God Almighty",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "El Shaddai",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " appeared to me at Luz in the land of Canaan and blessed me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and said to me, ‘Behold, I will make you fruitful, and multiply you, and I will make of you a company of peoples, and will give this land to your descendants after you for an everlasting possession.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now your two sons, who were born to you in the land of Egypt before I came to you in Egypt, are mine; Ephraim and Manasseh shall be mine, as Reuben and Simeon are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the offspring born to you after them shall be yours; they shall be called by the name of their brothers in their inheritance. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For when I came from Paddan, Rachel to my sorrow died in the land of Canaan on the way, when there was still some distance to go to Ephrath; and I buried her there on the way to Ephrath (that is, Bethlehem).”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Israel saw Joseph's sons, he said, “Who are these?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joseph said to his father, “They are my sons, whom God has given me here.” And he said, “Bring them to me, I pray you, that I may bless them.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the eyes of Israel were dim with age, so that he could not see. So Joseph brought them near him; and he kissed them and embraced them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Israel said to Joseph, “I had not thought to see your face; and lo, God has let me see your children also.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Joseph removed them from his knees, and he bowed himself with his face to the earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Joseph took them both, Ephraim in his right hand toward Israel's left hand, and Manasseh in his left hand toward Israel's right hand, and brought them near him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Israel stretched out his right hand and laid it upon the head of Ephraim, who was the younger, and his left hand upon the head of Manasseh, crossing his hands, for Manasseh was the first-born. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he blessed Joseph, and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Joseph saw that his father laid his right hand upon the head of Ephraim, it displeased him; and he took his father's hand, to remove it from Ephraim's head to Manasseh's head. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Joseph said to his father, “Not so, my father; for this one is the first-born; put your right hand upon his head.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But his father refused, and said, “I know, my son, I know; he also shall become a people, and he also shall be great; nevertheless his younger brother shall be greater than he, and his descendants shall become a multitude of nations.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he blessed them that day, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
